              "creation_time": "2024-06-28T10:41:07Z",
              "creator": "ctanase@mozilla.com",
              "id": 17003745,
              "is_private": false,
              "raw_text": "**Environment:**\nOperating system: Windows 10\nFirefox version: Firefox Nightly 129.0a1 (2024-06-27)\n\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Go to https://www.webmd.com/drugs/2/drug-8791-718/hydrocortisone-butyrate-cream/details\n2. Observe the magnifying glass inside the search field (below the \"Can we help you find something else?\").\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\nThe magnifying glass is centered.\n\n**Actual Behavior:**\nThe magnifying glass is aligned slightly lower.\n\n**Notes:**\n1. Screenshot attached\n2. Reproducible regardless of the ETP status\n3. Reproducible on Firefox Release as well\n4. Not reproducible on Chrome\n5. Issue found during WebCompat team [Top100] websites testing",
              "reactions": {},
              "tags": [],
              "text": "Created attachment 9410103\nFF vs Chrome.png\n\n**Environment:**\nOperating system: Windows 10\nFirefox version: Firefox Nightly 129.0a1 (2024-06-27)\n\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Go to https://www.webmd.com/drugs/2/drug-8791-718/hydrocortisone-butyrate-cream/details\n2. Observe the magnifying glass inside the search field (below the \"Can we help you find something else?\").\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\nThe magnifying glass is centered.\n\n**Actual Behavior:**\nThe magnifying glass is aligned slightly lower.\n\n**Notes:**\n1. Screenshot attached\n2. Reproducible regardless of the ETP status\n3. Reproducible on Firefox Release as well\n4. Not reproducible on Chrome\n5. Issue found during WebCompat team [Top100] websites testing",
              "time": "2024-06-28T10:41:07Z"
            },
